        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia na shigukulu sha pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosia ūlagīja gīkī ībize ho pasaka ū mu Yelusalemu kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA; ī ng'holo ja pasaka jūsīnzwa mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'inè ng'weji gwa kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji ūbahelela ī ndīīma jabo; hūna ūbatimbya ng'holò gīkī bagwīte mu welwa ng'holò ū nīmo gwa mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī, abo baalī baamala kwejiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, abo nīmo gwabo gwalī kūbalanga a banhū; ūbawīla, “Ī lisandīko lyeela lītūūlagi mu hekalu, īyo wīzenga Solomoni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Daūdi ntemi wa Isilaeli; mutī na nguno ya kwikala ng'ūlībūūcha ha mabega ging'we būlī makanza. Ī haha managi gīkī ū nīmo gwing'we gūlī kūntūmamīla SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, hamò na a banhū bakwe a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabanhīkagi būlī bene mu ndūgū jabo kūlondeela magele ging'we; gīt'ūmo kahelele ako katūūlwa na Daūdi ntemi wa Isilaeli, hamò nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īmīīlagi mu magelè magele, hamò nabo a baana ba ng'wing'we kūlondeela ndūgū ja basaabo; būlī hene lībize ho igelè lya Balawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī ng'holo ja pasaka mukūjisīnza bing'we; na lūūlū iyeejagi mujigolanyī ī ng'holo ja pasaka jenījo kūlwa nguno ya baana ba ng'wing'we; ng'wīte gīt'ūmo SEEBA alagīlile mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha sha pasaka īsho akafunya ū Yosia kūlwa nguno ya banhū bose abo baalīho ho a henaho, jalī ng'holo hamò na mbūli shihumbī makūmi adatū, na nzagamba shihūmbī shidatū. Ī jose jenījo jalī ja kūfuma mu sabo ja ntemi dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami bakwe nabo būfunya kūlwa nguno ya banhū, na a bagabīji hamò na a Balawī. A batūmami ba mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu a ba Hilikia, Zakalia nū Yehieli būbinha a bagabīji shakwinha sha pasaka, mitugo shihūmbī shibīlī na magana atandatū, na ng'ombe magana adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Konania nang'hwe hamò na a baana ba ng'wawe a ba Shemaya nū Nesaneeli; hamò na a batongeeji ba Balawī a ba Hashabia, Yeieli nū Yozabadi, būfunya shakwinha sha pasaka kūlwa nguno ya Balawī, ng'holo na mbūli shihūmbī shitanò, na ng'ombe magana atanò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigukulu sha pasaka kūyegelwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza aho lyang'wa, a bagabīji bīmīīla būlī ng'wene h'ipandī lyakwe, a Balawī nabo bihela mu magele gabo gīt'ūmo walī walagīīlīla ū ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mitugo ja pasaka jandya kūsīnzwa, a bagabīji nabo bandya kūgaseseebela a mininga ayo binhīlījiagwa; a Balawī h'abo bajibaagaga ī mitugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa būshitūūla ha mhūjo kūlwa kūbinha a banhū ūmo baalī bigasha mu magele mado mado, kūlondeela ndūgū ja basaabo, gīkī bafunye shitambò kūlī SEEBA, gīt'ūmo yandīkilwe mu Shitabo sha ng'wa Musa. Nī nzagamba būjīīta gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mitugo ja pasaka būjoocha gīt'ūmo īhayīlilwe; ī shakwinha ī sheela būshizuga ī shene mu manengelo, masufulia, na mazugīlo gangī gangī, hūna būjigabanhya wangū ū kū banhū a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho hū bibeegeja nī shabo na a bagabīji; nguno a bagabīji, a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni baalī na nīmo gwa kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemvwa, hamò na a masazu; kūshisha wil'ū būjikū. Na lūūlū a Balawī būbeeja ī shabo nī sha bagabīji ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bīmbi a ba shibyalwe sha ng'wa Asafu baalī ū mu mapandī gabo ayo baalī bahelelwa na Daūdi hamò na Asafu na Hemani na Yedusuni, abo baalī baboni ba ntemi. A balang'hani ba ha mibita baalī batī na nguno ya kwīnga a ha mapandī gabo, nguno a bichaabo a Balawī bakabalonja longeja nabo ī shabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū nīmo gwa kūnamya SEEBA mu nzīla ya kwīyegela ī pasaka, gwītwa mu lūshikū lwenūlo pyī ū gose; nū nīmo gwa kūfunya ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa gwītwa gīt'ūmo ntemi Yosia walī walagīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli abo baalīho ī likanza lyenīlo būmala shikū mpungatī bakwīyegelaga ī Psaska nī shigukulu sha migatī ītī na shibimbya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī pasaka yalī ītaalī kūyegelwa gīko ū mu Isilaeli kūfuma mu shikū ja ng'hangi Sang'weli. Walī atīho ntemi wa Isilaeli nūūlū ūmò ūyo walī wabīta kwīyegela ī pasaka gīt'ūmo akīītīla ū Yosia; kwīlya hamò na bagabīji, Balawī, na a banhū ba Yuda a bose, na a Baisilaeli abo baalīho hoi, hamò na a banhū ba Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī pasaka yenīyo īkaliwa mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'īnaane ū mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yosia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yosia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yose yenīyī, ū Yosia aho wamalamaja ū kwīgolanya ī hekalu, Neko ntemi wa Misili ūbūūka kūjiilwisha būlūgū Kakemishi kū mongo gwa Fulati. Ū Yosia ūnchaamīīla gīkī alwe būlūgū nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Neko ūntūmīla banhū kūng'wīla, “Bebe ntemi wa Yuda, gūlīho mhayo kī a ha gatī yako nū nene? Ī likanza lyenīlī natizile kūkūūbūkīla bebe, najile kū banhū abo nalī na wilwisha nabo; ū Mulungu wanikomigile naje wangū, na lūūlū lekaga ū kwīhangīja īyo īhelilwe na Mulungu ūyo alī hamò nane, nguno akūkūkenaagūla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Yosia atanyamukile gīkī aleke ū kūnchaamīīla; ūzwalīla shizwalo sha kūng'wīta ajimīīlīke, hūna ūja kwilwisha nang'hwe ū būlūgū. Ūbiza walema ū kwīyigwa īyo wīhayaga ū Neko kūlwa kūlagīlwa na Mulungu. Ūja dūhū kūndumīla, ū būlūgū wenūbo būlwīlwa ha mbūga ya Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balasi būnasa ū ntemi Yosia; hūna ūbawīla a batūmami bakwe, “Nīnjagi a henaha munitwale, nalabūlwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīnja ū ng'wigogoteni lyakwe, būntūūla ng'wigogoteni līngī walī nalyo, būnshosha Yelusalemu ūūkashikīla kūcha. Ūjīkwa mu shigila sha bakūlūgenji bakwe; pye a banhū ba Yuda nī Yelusalemu būnīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelemia ūbeeja mīmbo ga kūnīla ū Yosia; kūshisha lelo īyī pye a bagosha na a bakīma a bīmbi bataalī bakang'wizūkagwa ū Yosia ū mu mīmbo ga ng'hūngū genayo. Shūbiza shīmīle sha banhū ū mu Isilaeli ū kwīmba a mīmbo genayo; nīyo ī haha gandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūngū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
